detection_limitations:
No Romanized Bangla support; limited interpretability; only static text-image content, with no audio/video or network-level propagation analysis; dataset size is only 9,600 and may not cover regional dialects or evolving misinformation;
MultiFusionFake is computationally heavy for resource-constrained deployment.
Future work: Romanized Bangla, audio/video, real-time detection, XAI, ViT-based encoders, dialect expansion, online/active learning, lightweight deployment, LLM/LVLM evidence retrieval, and broader deception categories.

